👨‍💻 About the Creator

Ibrahim Salehe is the founder of LUMINEXA, a technology and engineering brand focused on designing and building innovative projects.

He is a Designer, Builder, and Technology Enthusiast from Tanzania, East Africa 🇹🇿.

His interests include:

- ⚙️ Mechatronics Engineering
- 🤖 Robotics
- 🔌 Electronics
- 💻 Embedded Systems
- 🌐 IoT
- 🧠 Artificial Intelligence
- 🛠️ Hardware Design & Prototyping

LumiWeather is one of his embedded-systems projects, combining the ESP32, OLED display, Wi-Fi connectivity, and weather API technology to create a compact weather information device.

